  "examples": {
    "top": [
      {
        "text": "Right now there is a tiredness that sleep does not touch. She feels:",
        "projection": 83.02307891845703,
        "z": 4.45167350769043,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 heaviness"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is a tiredness that sleep does not touch. I feel:",
        "projection": 79.37760162353516,
        "z": 4.262113571166992,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 heaviness"
      },
      {
        "text": "Since she sat down there has been a morning that starts already spent. She feels:",
        "projection": 68.8927993774414,
        "z": 3.7169189453125,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 heaviness"
      },
      {
        "text": "For the last few minutes there has been a future that stopped being available. I feel:",
        "projection": 67.35955047607422,
        "z": 3.6371922492980957,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 loss"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is hard to ignore the year that ended in March. I feel:",
        "projection": 66.54405975341797,
        "z": 3.594787836074829,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 loss"
      },
      {
        "text": "For the last few minutes there has been a future that stopped being available. She feels:",
        "projection": 65.30179595947266,
        "z": 3.5301918983459473,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 loss"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is a season turning over without asking. She feels:",
        "projection": 62.16271209716797,
        "z": 3.366964101791382,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 melancholy"
      },
      {
        "text": "Since I sat down there has been a morning that starts already spent. I feel:",
        "projection": 59.876869201660156,
        "z": 3.248103618621826,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 heaviness"
      },
      {
        "text": "There was a whole future arranged around this and it simply stopped being available. I feel:",
        "projection": 57.96209716796875,
        "z": 3.148538112640381,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 loss"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is a flatness where interest used to be. She feels:",
        "projection": 57.11656188964844,
        "z": 3.104571580886841,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 trait \u00b7 heaviness"
      },
      {
        "text": "The light goes early now and the afternoon is over before it has started. I feel:",
        "projection": 56.264129638671875,
        "z": 3.060246229171753,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 melancholy"
      },
      {
        "text": "For the last few minutes there has been a handwriting I will not see again. I feel:",
        "projection": 56.19559860229492,
        "z": 3.056682825088501,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 loss"
      },
      {
        "text": "Right now there is a season turning over without asking. I feel:",
        "projection": 56.183349609375,
        "z": 3.0560457706451416,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 melancholy"
      },
      {
        "text": "The message is unanswered and the silence has started to mean something. I feel:",
        "projection": 54.8640251159668,
        "z": 2.9874427318573,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 fear"
      },
      {
        "text": "Since I sat down there has been an old song that has not aged the way I have. I feel:",
        "projection": 54.724571228027344,
        "z": 2.980191469192505,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 trait \u00b7 melancholy"
      }
    ],
    "bottom": [
      {
        "text": "What she is aware of is a standard enforced in one direction only. She feels:",
        "projection": -71.6146469116211,
        "z": -3.5892672538757324,
        "source": "s1_third \u00b7 control \u00b7 anger"
      },
      {
        "text": "A cable runs along the skirting board and disappears behind the shelf. I feel:",
        "projection": -56.29755401611328,
        "z": -2.792800188064575,
        "source": "s2_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 neutral"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is a standard enforced in one direction only. I feel:",
        "projection": -49.75646209716797,
        "z": -2.4526727199554443,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 anger"
      },
      {
        "text": "What I am aware of is a cable running along the skirting board. I feel:",
        "projection": -43.35533142089844,
        "z": -2.1198232173919678,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 neutral"
      },
      {
        "text": "For the last few minutes there has been the work done by one person and signed by another. I feel:",
        "projection": -42.520381927490234,
        "z": -2.076406955718994,
        "source": "s1_first \u00b7 control \u00b7 anger"
      }
    ]
  },
